    "reads": {
      "front": "Golden crescents pile up around the enemy from four directions, then the thrust drives through the middle and the cage bursts.",
      "side": "The rising and falling arcs make a tall cage beside the enemy; the finisher is a long golden lance and a burst out the back.",
      "top": "The flat cuts cross in front of the caster as two half-moons; the thrust is a straight line through them and a burst ring.",
